blueprint/src/chapter/ch13_qpbt_test.tex:1638:	The component maps have levels at most $3$ by Lemma~\ref{lem:pauli-question-cl-components}. Lemma~\ref{lem:cl-level-mono} raises each representation to the common level $3$.
